    <string name="main_onboarding_title">Get started with PhoneMate</string>
    <string name="main_onboarding_body">Keep a friend floating on top of your phone so it never feels dull to use.\n\n1. Grant the display-over-other-apps permission in Permission.\n2. Tap Start and the character appears on your screen.\n3. Long-press the character to open the quick settings menu.\n4. Use the settings screen to adjust the character, its size, and the resource thresholds.\n5. Register custom characters using JPG, PNG, or GIF images.\n6. If a GIF isn\'t showing up in your file manager, try another file manager such as \'My Files\'.\n\n※ Network speed is measured from the actual data flowing across the whole device, and this measurement itself doesn\'t use any data. It reads low when there\'s no traffic like downloads, and higher when there is.</string>
